# Force LF line endings for all text files in this repo, regardless of a
# contributor's global core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows checkouts
# convert working-tree line endings to CRLF, which Prettier (configured for
# LF) then flags as a formatting violation on files that are otherwise
# byte-identical to what's committed - breaking the release pipeline's
# format:check gate on every Windows machine, every time.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
